navigator.share() on OHOS goes to the shell's share sheet.

chrome::ohos::BindAuraShellShareService (aura_shell_runtime_bridge.cc)
serves blink.mojom.ShareService for each document and sends the title, text
and URL to the shell as a shareRequested event. The same block binds
blink.mojom.DateTimeChooser to chrome::ohos::BindAuraShellDateTimeChooser
(see ohos-native-pickers.patch): two patches cannot both edit it without
one of them failing the already-applied check. Upstream binds the service
only on Windows, ChromeOS, macOS and Android; the Blink feature is turned on
by --enable-blink-features=WebShare from ohos_chrome_main_runner.cc.

Generated against Chromium 154.0.8037.51 with chromium-154-harmonyos.patch
applied. Apply with:
  git apply ohos-web-share.patch

